        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8444, 1-1/2 x 11 Rectangular Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1.5 x 11 Modern Rectangular Brass Stretto Patio Door Trim is great for use on narrow trim patio doors that are not setup for multi-point trim locks. The Rectangular Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset works with a tubular latch and is available in a keyed entry function and a double dummy function. This Rectangular 1.5 x 11 Stretto Trim is made out of brass and is available in satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, polished nickel, satin nickel, flat black, polished chrome, and unlaquered brass finishes. The modern appearance of the Stretto line Narrow Trim Handleset a great choice for contemporary or modern decor. Choose from a wide array of trim knobs and levers for a custom look.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStretto Narrow Trim Locksets use a tubular latch. This patio door lock requires a 1-1/4\" diameter bore hole and a 2-hole door preparation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Stretto Style Narrow Trim Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3 please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different knobs or levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 x 11 Modern Rectangular Brass Stretto Patio Door Trim, Emtek 8444",
                "description": "The 1.5 x 11 Modern Rectangular Brass Stretto Patio Door Trim is great for use on narrow trim patio doors that are not setup for multi-point trim locks. The Rectangular Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset works with a tubular latch and is available in a keyed entry function and a double dummy function. The Brass Rectangular 1.5 x 11 Stretto Trim is made out of brass and is available in satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, polished nickel, satin nickel, flat black, polished chrome, and unlaquered brass finishes. The modern appearance of the Stretto line Narrow Trim Handleset a great choice for contemporary or modern decor. Choose from a wide array of trim knobs and levers for a custom look.",
                "keywords": "1.5 x 11 Rectangular Style Patio Locksets, Brass Rectangular 1-1/2 x 11 Stretto Trims, 1.5 x 11 Rectangular Brass Stretto Patio Door Trims, EMT-8444, EMT-8044, Emtek 8444, Emtek 8044, Stretto Narrow Trim Locksets, 1-1/2 x 11 Rectangular Style Narrow Trim Patio Locksets, Square Style Stretto Style Narrow Trim Locks,"
